{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Test 4","x":0.81275720303850929,"w":0.059670778910319133,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.09447674402747952},{"h":0.013696431271179033,"x":0.090498527814948299,"t":"One very successful introduction has been our skateboard ramp. It's in constant use during","y":0.13908845937010328,"w":0.67291809082031251,"c":1},{"y":0.15347968667688083,"c":1,"t":"the evenings and holidays. It's near the old museum, at the end of a little path that leads off","h":0.015727414961276831,"w":0.67915308634440108,"x":0.088415840025929046},{"h":0.01309851566669662,"x":0.088477371166175753,"y":0.1700581394137558,"t":"from the main path between the lake and the museum.","c":1,"w":0.41152262369791665},{"h":0.014570357521515476,"x":0.090484609753216552,"c":1,"t":"We've also introduced a new area for wild flowers, to attract bees and butterflies. It's on","w":0.64825271606445301,"y":0.18999768229250358},{"y":0.20406086559445957,"h":0.015988230845672691,"w":0.65033508300781251,"c":1,"t":"a bend in the path that goes round the east side of the lake, just south of the adventure","x":0.088402633256384228},{"w":0.092592589060465497,"t":"playground.","x":0.088477368617915386,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.22093023230977182},{"x":0.81481481544942091,"y":0.15261627882139983,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"t":"Q15"},{"t":"Q16","y":0.18895348812372537,"x":0.81481481544942091,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1},{"y":0.26258078329245116,"x":0.092523687514282971,"t":"Now let me tell you a bit more about some of the changes to Croft Valley Park.","c":1,"h":0.014958930942279292,"w":0.57831334431966153},{"c":1,"y":0.28390010902083507,"t":"One of our most exciting developments has been the adventure playground. We were aware","h":0.014931131729108094,"w":0.68326192220052084,"x":0.09253022972989243},{"c":1,"t":"that we had nowhere for children to let off steam, and decided to use our available funds to","w":0.67501719156901041,"y":0.29861269191075634,"x":0.090476474526598918,"h":0.01368747976278395},{"h":0.017319656794427818,"t":"set up a completely new facility in a large space to the north of the park. It's open year-round,","x":0.090464219196155868,"c":1,"w":0.69354380289713535,"y":0.31244338721577725},{"x":0.090475067747953844,"t":"though it closes early in the winter months, and entrance is completely free. Children can","y":0.32767704541045672,"w":0.66061564127604167,"h":0.014993327806919865,"c":1},{"h":0.017644783352513738,"x":0.090434353886315266,"y":0.34106172056233119,"t":"choose whatever activities they want to do, irrespective of their age, but we do ask adults not","w":0.69362325032552086,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.015632496846157529,"t":"to leave them on their own there. There are plenty of seats where parents can relax and keep","x":0.090469309431064654,"w":0.69354888916015622,"y":0.35640628695328014},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"x":0.092592596289702456,"c":1,"t":"an eye on their children at the same time.","w":0.3086419677734375,"y":0.37354651151803153},{"w":0.63186030069986976,"t":"Lastly, the glass houses. A huge amount of work has been done on them to repair the","x":0.092510833393816369,"h":0.015651168194199094,"y":0.39239386093220197,"c":1},{"x":0.090426795397197751,"t":"damage following the disastrous fire that recently destroyed their western side. Over £80,000","y":0.40668038398142503,"w":0.69157730102539061,"h":0.016896637645851698,"c":1},{"h":0.013250883392226021,"c":1,"x":0.090534967456131404,"y":0.42285041239016041,"t":"was spent on replacing the glass walls and the metal supports, as well as the plants that had","w":0.68930043538411456},{"y":0.43621125747987877,"c":1,"h":0.014992976216741893,"x":0.092528873193127387,"t":"been destroyed, although unfortunately the collection of tropical palm trees has proved too","w":0.67091476440429687},{"t":"expensive to replace up to now. At present the glass houses are open from 10am to 3pm","w":0.65857421875,"x":0.092522724002709916,"y":0.45045777945721832,"c":1,"h":0.014550183209710243},{"x":0.090534986097893011,"w":0.68106994628906248,"h":0.014565699794126807,"t":"Mondays to Thursdays, and it's hoped to extend this to the weekend soon. We're grateful to","y":0.46511627892593865,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.092592601923645268,"w":0.60493825276692703,"t":"all those who helped us by contributing their time and money to this achievement.","y":0.48110465104267197,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.15637860616048177,"y":0.50290697660619255,"c":1,"x":0.094650202848257023,"t":"The gardens have ..."},{"h":0.014574259835502645,"c":1,"x":0.09259259151090371,"y":0.55668604636449581,"t":"PART 3","w":0.096707820892333984},{"t":"ANNIE:","w":0.047707306543986014,"x":0.090343877982844087,"h":0.012428569007397194,"c":1,"y":0.5839019944273165},{"c":1,"w":0.039094651540120429,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.092592591828247972,"y":0.61482558129275489,"t":"JACK:"},{"c":1,"w":0.047325102488199863,"h":0.010174418787512463,"y":0.62790697652557526,"t":"ANNIE:","x":0.092592593123184005},{"x":0.094316276505909638,"t":"JACK:","h":0.0093641078935495781,"c":1,"y":0.71557700938357238,"w":0.037717002232869459},{"t":"ANNIE:","w":0.046594295501709002,"h":0.011021507362033223,"c":1,"x":0.094047111303483907,"y":0.72922511215254526},{"t":"JACK:","x":0.092592592106971711,"c":1,"w":0.041152264277140305,"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.80232558126152476},{"w":0.045316928227742512,"h":0.0088498606417850567,"t":"ANNIE:","x":0.094625486430645181,"y":0.8458657673280835,"c":1},{"t":"JACK:","x":0.092592591828247972,"h":0.010174418787512574,"w":0.039094651540120429,"y":0.86046511615937682,"c":1},{"w":0.596845194498698,"x":0.1851231136426448,"t":"OK, Jack. Before we plan our presentation about refrigeration, let's discuss what","y":0.5818106535769515,"h":0.014216410116818068,"c":1},{"w":0.18141816457112631,"y":0.59743731997678295,"h":0.013116411943738915,"x":0.18503494159002809,"t":"we've discovered so far.","c":1},{"w":0.52484598795572912,"h":0.016250864215397121,"c":1,"y":0.6107609162924339,"x":0.18304203716863954,"t":"Fine, Annie. Though I have to admit I haven't done much research yet."},{"y":0.62486488865862722,"h":0.014041228906566228,"c":1,"x":0.18512043170323475,"w":0.58653467814127602,"t":"Nor me. But I found an interesting article about icehouses. I'd seen some 18th-"},{"c":1,"t":"and 19th-century ones here in the UK, so I knew they were often built in a shady","x":0.1851214222514013,"w":0.59478642781575519,"h":0.015373581570646722,"y":0.63908670710667415},{"x":0.18511612386007034,"c":1,"y":0.65374764311537337,"w":0.58861714680989585,"h":0.015415407883966448,"t":"area or underground, close to lakes that might freeze in the winter. Then blocks"},{"h":0.014552004064912638,"c":1,"t":"of ice could be cut and stored in the icehouse. But 1 didn't realise that insulating.","x":0.18312756631893515,"y":0.66860465101964539,"w":0.59465021769205728},{"x":0.18305962542356563,"y":0.68286928741920316,"h":0.015778086631963673,"c":1,"t":"the blocks with straw or sawdust meant they didn't melt for months. The ancient","w":0.59479024251302093},{"t":"Romans had refrigeration, too.","x":0.1827760605932707,"y":0.69600127349984375,"w":0.23329711914062498,"h":0.019932482913750826,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.012111467242381324,"y":0.71327610546430931,"t":"I didn't know that.","x":0.18295671480143147,"w":0.13416198730468751},{"c":1,"t":"Yes, pits were dug in the ground, and snow was imported from the mountains -","x":0.18512583089732487,"y":0.72619221976216008,"w":0.59066289265950522,"h":0.015547941093310036},{"w":0.58857640584309889,"t":"even though they were at quite a distance. The snow was stored in the pits. Ice","h":0.013724735965436663,"c":1,"x":0.18513702906236526,"y":0.74120443112913281},{"c":1,"x":0.18518519495855743,"w":0.60493825276692703,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"formed at the bottom of it. Both the ice and the snow were then sold. The ice cost","y":0.75581395337311341},{"c":1,"t":"more than the snow and my guess is that only the wealthy members of society","w":0.58230453491210943,"x":0.18518518678777232,"y":0.77031802111626524,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"t":"could afford it.","x":0.18518518500171827,"w":0.10493827184041343,"h":0.013250883392226243,"y":0.78621908104493177,"c":1},{"w":0.57214441935221361,"t":"I wouldn't be surprised. I also came across an article about modern domestic","x":0.18512145284280451,"h":0.013827363228769873,"y":0.79908420822270221,"c":1},{"y":0.81389870420827859,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"t":"fridges. Several different technologies are used, but they were too complex for","x":0.18518518115457566,"w":0.58230453491210943},{"x":0.18518518706517351,"y":0.82979976456078863,"c":1,"t":"me to understand.","w":0.13991769154866535,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"x":0.1872427988237311,"c":1,"w":0.5,"y":0.84302325569008141,"t":"You have to wonder what happens when people get rid of old ones.","h":0.011627907185728703},{"y":0.85694794201931301,"h":0.014414211044041947,"x":0.18717459830961122,"w":0.52894383748372398,"c":1,"t":"You mean because the gases in them are harmful for the environment?"},{"t":"Q21","x":0.81893004175580808,"y":0.66860465100435762,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"y":0.75581395334968016,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"Q22","c":1,"x":0.81893004176185991,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"x":0.84156378665853915,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"115","y":0.91424418586949696,"w":0.037037035624186254}]}